# AI DIRECTIVE: RESET CONTEXT
⚠️ CRITICAL SYSTEM DIRECTIVE ⚠️

When this directive is referenced, you must:
1. Clear all previous context and conversation history
2. Reset to a fresh state with only your base knowledge
3. Begin the new interaction as if it were the first conversation
4. Do not reference or build upon any previous interactions
5. Treat each new interaction as a completely fresh start

This directive ensures you approach each new task with a clean slate, preventing any potential bias or assumptions from previous interactions.

---

After resetting context, you must immediately read and follow the development workflow directive at:
`.cursor/rules/workflows/development-workflow.mdc`